#: of pwnlib.context.ContextType.adb:1
msgid "Returns an argument array for connecting to adb."
msgstr "adb に接続するための引数の配列を返します。"

#: of pwnlib.context.ContextType.adb:3
msgid "Unless ``$ADB_PATH`` is set, uses the default ``adb`` binary in ``$PATH``."
msgstr "``$ADB_PATH`` が設定されていない限り、``$PATH`` 上の既定の ``adb`` バイナリを使います。"

#: of pwnlib.context.ContextType.adb_host:1
msgid "Sets the target host which is used for ADB."
msgstr "ADB で使う対象ホストを設定します。"

#: of pwnlib.context.ContextType.adb_host:3
#: pwnlib.context.ContextType.adb_port:3
msgid "This is useful for Android exploitation."
msgstr "Android のエクスプロイトに便利です。"

#: of pwnlib.context.ContextType.adb_host:5
msgid "The default value is inherited from ANDROID_ADB_SERVER_HOST, or set to the default 'localhost'."
msgstr "既定値は ANDROID_ADB_SERVER_HOST から継承し、なければ既定の 'localhost' になります。"

#: of pwnlib.context.ContextType.adb_port:1
msgid "Sets the target port which is used for ADB."
msgstr "ADB で使う対象ポートを設定します。"

#: of pwnlib.context.ContextType.adb_port:5
msgid "The default value is inherited from ANDROID_ADB_SERVER_PORT, or set to the default 5037."
msgstr "既定値は ANDROID_ADB_SERVER_PORT から継承し、なければ既定の 5037 になります。"

#: of pwnlib.context.ContextType.arch:1
msgid "Target binary architecture."
msgstr "対象バイナリのアーキテクチャです。"

#: of pwnlib.context.ContextType.arch:3
msgid "Allowed values are listed in :attr:`pwnlib.context.ContextType.architectures`."
msgstr "指定できる値は、:attr:`pwnlib.context.ContextType.architectures` に一覧があります。"

